protocol keys from Qualcomm's MediaCodec vendor extensions. SnapConverter is
not affiliated with Qualcomm Technologies, Inc.

This product links Netflix libvmaf (BSD-2-Clause-Patent) for optional VMAF
scoring after encode. See engine/src/main/cpp/vmaf/include and Netflix/vmaf.

